      "summaryText": "The `drizzle-kit migrate` command applies SQL migrations generated by `drizzle-kit generate` for the code-first approach to managing Drizzle migrations. It reads all `.sql` files from the migration folder, connects to the database to fetch entries from the drizzle migrations log table, decides which new migrations to run based on previously applied ones, then runs the SQL migrations and logs them to the drizzle migrations table.",
