      "inputChecksum": "9dd0f170c6fa3108190c7334f40c12f95f7a4bc469f80996d5f24d1be86b097f",
      "summaryText": "Drizzle ORM does not include code to create the `pg_vector` extension within the schema, assuming it is already installed in your PostgreSQL database. The `pg_vector` extension is an open-source vector similarity search solution for Postgres that stores vectors alongside other data. It supports exact and approximate nearest neighbor search, single/half-precision and binary/sparse vectors, and distance metrics including L2, inner product, cosine, L1, Hamming, and Jaccard.",
