      "inputChecksum": "bf0bbdadf488b736f241469c94e72f43286b224e34e2fdab2fe820975079cf4b",
      "summaryText": "pgvector requires an explicit operator class for HNSW and IVFFlat indexes because no default exists. This requirement affects anyone using pgvector with Drizzle's `push` workflow.",
