      "summaryText": "The `hnsw.max_scan_tuples` setting specifies the maximum number of tuples to visit during an iterative scan, defaulting to 20,000, and is approximate without affecting the initial scan. The `hnsw.scan_mem_multiplier` setting specifies the maximum memory to use as a multiple of `work_mem`, defaulting to 1, and should be increased if raising `hnsw.max_scan_tuples` does not improve recall.",
