      "inputChecksum": "0afa62005f615bd4d9681cdb9eeceedc59e497570235e881150ee017728733eb",
      "summaryText": "The `$effect` automatically tracks reactive values (`$state`, `$derived`, `$props`) that are synchronously read inside its function body, including indirectly through function calls, and schedules a re-run when those dependencies change. Values read asynchronously—after an `await` or inside a `setTimeout`—are not tracked, and `$state` and `$derived` used directly inside the `$effect` are not treated as dependencies.",
      "outputChecksum": "b17fa49f5374574ba57d9f05d5ccb85bc790a98a4f45ac7ca068976b69152400",
